  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a large skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add the sliced onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the sliced mushrooms and cook until they are tender.",
    "Add the diced potato and cook for 5 minutes.",
    "Add the cherries, garlic, thyme, salt, and pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer, covered, for 20 minutes.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with fresh herbs if desired.",
    "Let it rest for a few minutes before serving.",
